WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.601
KUMAIL NANJIANI
We are from the cast of...

00:00:02.651 --> 00:00:03.836
GEMMA CHAN
And here's everything you need to know

00:00:03.886 --> 00:00:04.651
about our film...

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:06.022
DON LEE
...in 60 seconds.

00:00:06.073 --> 00:00:06.870
KUMAIL NANJIANI
[Inhales]

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:07.726
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Boom.

00:00:07.776 --> 00:00:08.601
BARRY KEOGHAN
Big bang.

00:00:08.651 --> 00:00:10.383
SALMA HAYEK
The universe comes into existence.

00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:12.289
RICHARD MADDEN
Powerful beings known as the Celestials

00:00:12.339 --> 00:00:13.146
roam the universe.

00:00:13.196 --> 00:00:14.911
KUMAIL NANJIANI
I think the Infinity Stones show up.

00:00:14.961 --> 00:00:15.865
Maybe? I don't know!

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.302
KINGO
That explains so much.

00:00:17.352 --> 00:00:19.496
LIA MCHUGH
A power Celestial creates the Eternals.

00:00:19.547 --> 00:00:20.482
SALMA HAYEK
That's us!

00:00:20.532 --> 00:00:22.532
KARUN
The original superheroes.

00:00:23.282 --> 00:00:24.857
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
5000 B.C.

00:00:24.907 --> 00:00:26.177
BARRY KEOGHAN
Suddenly, the Deviants emerge

00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:27.793
to destroy all life in existence.

00:00:27.844 --> 00:00:28.497
LAUREN RIDLOFF [in sign language]
Really scary.

00:00:28.547 --> 00:00:30.066
KUMAIL NANJIANI
They are literally the worst.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.021
SALMA HAYEK
And the Eternals are sent to Earth

00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:35.553
aboard a giant
spaceship named the Domo.

00:00:35.603 --> 00:00:37.533
GEMMA CHAN
And save humanity from extinction.

00:00:39.447 --> 00:00:41.116
ANGELINA JOLIE
Fast forward hundreds of years...

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.124
GEMMA CHAN
The Eternals eliminate the

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:45.107
last two Deviants
and decide to break up.

00:00:45.158 --> 00:00:45.796
LAUREN RIDLOFF [in sign language]
Bummer!

00:00:45.846 --> 00:00:49.022
SALMA HAYEK
Gilgamesh learns a delicious pie recipe.

00:00:49.072 --> 00:00:50.741
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Sersi starts dating Dane Whitman.

00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:51.712
DANE WHITMAN
I'm Dane.

00:00:52.736 --> 00:00:54.466
ANGELINA JOLIE
Thanos destroys half of all life

00:00:54.516 --> 00:00:55.630
in the universe.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.606
LIA MCHUGH
Super annoying!

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.184
GEMMA CHAN
But the Avengers save the day

00:00:58.234 --> 00:00:59.122
and bring everyone back.

00:00:59.172 --> 00:00:59.716
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Yay.

00:00:59.766 --> 00:01:01.766
SALMA HAYEK
Out of nowhere, these annoying Deviants...

00:01:01.816 --> 00:01:03.058
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
...return with a vengeance.

00:01:03.109 --> 00:01:04.794
DON LEE
Now the Eternals must reunite

00:01:04.844 --> 00:01:06.353
to protect humanity once again.

00:01:06.404 --> 00:01:07.098
[Ding]

00:01:07.148 --> 00:01:08.302
AJAK
It is time.

00:01:08.352 --> 00:01:09.105
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Woo!

00:01:09.977 --> 00:01:11.356
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Phew! Did we do it?

00:01:11.406 --> 00:01:12.091
SALMA HAYEK
Did we?

00:01:12.141 --> 00:01:12.794
ANGELINA JOLIE
We done?

00:01:12.844 --> 00:01:13.610
GEMMA CHAN
I think we did it.

00:01:13.867 --> 00:01:14.986
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Don't miss Eternals. It’s here. In 10 Days.

